To deploy this document:
1. Download the official '농업기술길잡이 - 딸기' or '스마트팜 딸기 재배 매뉴얼' PDF from the Rural Development Administration (nongsaro.go.kr / smartfarmkorea.net).
2. Save/Overwrite this placeholder file inside the 'references/' folder with the exact filename:
   'KR_RDA_strawberry_smartfarm-manual_2022.pdf'
3. Push to the remote repository. The file will then open directly in the user's browser.
